      "preview": "מאזן: substantivo masculino dual, balanças; usos literais e figurados.",
      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מאזן</span>]</big>  <strong>subst.</strong>[<strong>masc.</strong>]<strong>dual: balanças, instrumentos de pesagem (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">مِيزَانٌ</span>, aramaico (nazar.) <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܘܙܰܢܶܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאזְנַיִם (־ָנ֑יִם)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a> + 4 ocorrências; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאזְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a> + 9 ocorrências—<em>balanças</em>, para pesar dinheiro <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.10\">Je 32:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶשְׁקֹל הַכֶּסֶף בְּמ׳</span>; cabelos <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.1\">Ez 5:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מ׳ מִשְׁקָל)</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁחַק מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a> <em>pó da balança</em>, comparação da insignificância das nações perante <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; figuradamente, calamidade <a data-ref=\"Job 6:2\" href=\"/Job.6.2\">Jb 6:2</a>; homens <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:10\" href=\"/Psalms.62.10\">ψ 62:10</a>; colinas <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.12\">Is 40:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שָׁקַל בַּפֶּלֶס הָרִים וּגְבָעוֹת בְּמ׳)</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ צֶדֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי־צ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפַת צ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הִין צ׳</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.10\">Ez 45:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפַת־צ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּת־צ׳</span>) cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.11\">Pr 16:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פֶּלָס וּא׳ מִשְׁפָּט)</span>; figuradamente <a data-ref=\"Job 31:6\" href=\"/Job.31.6\">Jb 31:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁקְלֵנִי בְּמ׳ צֶדֶק</span>; em oposição a <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ מִרְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.1\">Pr 11:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן שְׁלֵמָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.23\">20:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן וָאָ֑בֶן</span>) <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:5\" href=\"/Amos.8.5\">Am 8:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַקְטִין אֵיפָה וּלְהַגְדִּיל שֶׁקֶל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:8\" href=\"/Hosea.12.8\">Ho 12:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ רֶשַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:11\" href=\"/Micah.6.11\">Mi 6:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי מִרְמָה</span>).",
